# Project map

- `wiki/` — game design. Game terms: `wiki/glossary.md`
- `architecture/` — ADRs, tech stack
- `spec/` — Roadmap and Features (`spec/<slug>/`, never `feature_N`)
- `process/` — loop (`LOOP.md`) and process terms (`process/glossary.md`)
- `.cursor/rules/` — invariants. `.cursor/skills/` — procedures

Read `process/LOOP.md`. Use both glossaries. Do not implement a Feature until `spec/<slug>/tests/*.feature` exists.

Edit rules and skills only in Reflection, or when the user explicitly asks.
